WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.523
Continue by 10: 40, 50, 60, blank Let us think carefully. Add 10 three times from 40.

00:00:06.523 --> 00:00:08.755
The answer is 70. Great work!

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:17.274
Continue by 50: 100, 150, 200, blank Let us think carefully. Add 50 three times from

00:00:17.274 --> 00:00:20.625
100. The answer is 250. Great work!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:28.365
Continue by 100: 200, 300, 400, blank Let us think carefully. Add 100 three times

00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:32.053
from 200. The answer is 500. Great work!

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:40.584
Continue by 500: 0, 500, 1000, blank Let us think carefully. Add 500 three times from

00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:43.960
0. The answer is 1500. Great work!
